{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"code":"b_visit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF","role":"symbol","title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L382","fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift"},"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdent